  "description": "She only wanted to close the business deal successfully, but ended up having a successful one-night stand instead. Kang Chaeeun is thrown into a sudden business meeting to replace her father, who collapsed from a traffic accident.\n\nTrusting the rumor that the opposing company's executive director tends to hand out easy 'OKs' when he drinks, she diligently fills his glass. Yet strangely, as the glasses empty, it is Chaeeun, not the executive, who gets drunk.\n\nBranded with the humiliating titles of 'drinking hostess' and 'body-bartering executive,' Chaeeun stumbles her way into securing the contract.\n\nWhat began as purely business leads to a kiss, pulling the two into an unwritten clause not found in the contract.\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/120093544), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/120093545) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/4327007268), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/4327007267)",
